(7734580, 1274808, 91360, '<td valign="top">great shot well exposed and executed.</td>', 'great shot well exposed and executed.', '2022-12-14 13:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734582, 1274802, 91360, '<td valign="top">great macro shot.<br/>they are useful in cleaning. I believe they are doing it while disturbing others. I thing I know some of them..<br/>bty: I guess this was taken by Olympus M.Zuiko Digital ED 60mm 1:2.8 Macro :)</td>', 'great macro shot.they are useful in cleaning. I believe they are doing it while disturbing others. I thing I know some of them..bty: I guess this was taken by Olympus M.Zuiko Digital ED 60mm 1:2.8 Macro :)', '2022-12-14 13:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734588, 1274907, 122128, '<td valign="top">Kobi it is very nice amusing and smart shot of Natalie - it was shot in Yossi Adam''s workshop?</td>', 'Kobi it is very nice amusing and smart shot of Natalie - it was shot in Yossi Adam''s workshop?', '2022-12-14 15:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734719, 1274913, 114285, '<td valign="top">You''re not wrong about that :)</td>', 'You''re not wrong about that :)', '2022-12-16 03:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734763, 1274808, 30861, '<td valign="top">Or is it just a shoehorn? LOL...</td>', 'Or is it just a shoehorn? LOL...', '2022-12-16 13:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734764, 1274904, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s one HECK of a sky :-)</td>', 'That''s one HECK of a sky :-)', '2022-12-16 13:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734765, 1274802, 30861, '<td valign="top">Plus, they win ribbons :-)</td>', 'Plus, they win ribbons :-)', '2022-12-16 13:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734766, 1274913, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a hell of a logical dilemma, actually. It''s not a very GOOD drone shot so I should give it a 4, but on the other hand shouldn''t I be giving it a 10 so it is, in fact, overrated and earns a ribbon? You sly fox, whichever pilot you re :-)</td>', 'This is a hell of a logical dilemma, actually. It''s not a very GOOD drone shot so I should give it a 4, but on the other hand shouldn''t I be giving it a 10 so it is, in fact, overrated and earns a ribbon? You sly fox, whichever pilot you re :-)', '2022-12-16 13:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734787, 1274916, 83313, '<td valign="top">I haven''t a clue what I am looking at, but it is an appealing abstract.</td>', 'I haven''t a clue what I am looking at, but it is an appealing abstract.', '2022-12-16 17:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734808, 1274919, 141319, '<td valign="top">:-)</td>', ':-)', '2022-12-17 01:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734845, 1274926, 30049, '<td valign="top">This one made me smile.  :-)  Well done!</td>', 'This one made me smile.  :-)  Well done!', '2022-12-17 22:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734846, 1274924, 30049, '<td valign="top">Goats are better, they eat anything!  :-)</td>', 'Goats are better, they eat anything!  :-)', '2022-12-17 22:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734847, 1274903, 30049, '<td valign="top">Subtle. Mindfully inquisitive.  Well played.</td>', 'Subtle. Mindfully inquisitive.  Well played.', '2022-12-17 22:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734848, 1274904, 30049, '<td valign="top">Crystal clear image!  It''s like standing there and seeing it first hand.  I hope you list your settings in the image details - very curious to see.</td>', 'Crystal clear image!  It''s like standing there and seeing it first hand.  I hope you list your settings in the image details - very curious to see.', '2022-12-17 22:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734849, 1274912, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhhhh.  Sweet!</td>', 'Ahhhhhhhh.  Sweet!', '2022-12-17 22:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734850, 1274802, 30049, '<td valign="top">So ... you''re saying flies are underrated, yes?  :-)  Winner of the best / longest title thus far (still have 8 entries to get to).  LOL   Nice photo, as usual.</td>', 'So ... you''re saying flies are underrated, yes?  :-)  Winner of the best / longest title thus far (still have 8 entries to get to).  LOL   Nice photo, as usual.', '2022-12-17 22:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734871, 1274925, 29535, '<td valign="top">Hello there! The colours captured in the sky are very nice, but In think more time could have been spent on the crop and composition. This piece has no need to be a full frame shot, best crop out some of that dead space at the bottom and bring the eye towards the light.<br/> <br/>Even then, a more interesting sky would have been nicer. Clouds or even stars perhaps?<br/> <br/>As it stands you have a pretty good vantage point for future sunset shots. Explore around and see if you can take full advantage for a future shot!<br/> <br/>As for meeting the challenge I''m not sure the meaning has been interpreted correctly. Possible a language miscommunication, but not to worry, it happens!</td>', 'Hello there! The colours captured in the sky are very nice, but In think more time could have been spent on the crop and composition. This piece has no need to be a full frame shot, best crop out some of that dead space at the bottom and bring the eye towards the light. Even then, a more interesting sky would have been nicer. Clouds or even stars perhaps? As it stands you have a pretty good vantage point for future sunset shots. Explore around and see if you can take full advantage for a future shot! As for meeting the challenge I''m not sure the meaning has been interpreted correctly. Possible a language miscommunication, but not to worry, it happens!', '2022-12-18 10:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734872, 1274916, 29535, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest and say this is a little too abstract and over processed for me personally, and therefore I can''t give it a high mark. As for the concept meeting the challenge, the title suggests it could have but it''s hard to see it depicted in the image. I''d love to hear your thoughts about the piece regardless and then perhaps it will make more sense.</td>', 'I''ll be honest and say this is a little too abstract and over processed for me personally, and therefore I can''t give it a high mark. As for the concept meeting the challenge, the title suggests it could have but it''s hard to see it depicted in the image. I''d love to hear your thoughts about the piece regardless and then perhaps it will make more sense.', '2022-12-18 10:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734873, 1274700, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is quite a cool piece of artwork and I like the processing, but the shot is a little uninteresting to me technically and it would''ve been better perhaps more neatly lined up. I''d love to hear your thoughts when shooting it perhaps I''ve missed something.</td>', 'This is quite a cool piece of artwork and I like the processing, but the shot is a little uninteresting to me technically and it would''ve been better perhaps more neatly lined up. I''d love to hear your thoughts when shooting it perhaps I''ve missed something.', '2022-12-18 10:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734874, 1274903, 29535, '<td valign="top">Ah you know I''m revisiting this to comment and I think I get what you were attempting with the image concept now, so I''m bumping it slightly. However the shot is a little too high contrast and processed for me and the subject seems out of focus.</td>', 'Ah you know I''m revisiting this to comment and I think I get what you were attempting with the image concept now, so I''m bumping it slightly. However the shot is a little too high contrast and processed for me and the subject seems out of focus.', '2022-12-18 10:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734877, 1274751, 29535, '<td valign="top">I think this meets the challenge, and I quite like the subject. I''m not convinced there''s not a better composition somewhere, but as someone who struggles to photograph buildings I''m going to bump this to a 6.<br/> <br/>I do hope you don''t get downvoted by any angry Texans :)</td>', 'I think this meets the challenge, and I quite like the subject. I''m not convinced there''s not a better composition somewhere, but as someone who struggles to photograph buildings I''m going to bump this to a 6. I do hope you don''t get downvoted by any angry Texans :)', '2022-12-18 11:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734878, 1274902, 29535, '<td valign="top">It''s a technically solid shot, made a little soft by the DPC compression presumably. I''m going to give it a solid middle-ground mark though as it doesn''t feel too special to me, and I''m not sure love it/hate it translates perfectly to over or underrated.</td>', 'It''s a technically solid shot, made a little soft by the DPC compression presumably. I''m going to give it a solid middle-ground mark though as it doesn''t feel too special to me, and I''m not sure love it/hate it translates perfectly to over or underrated.', '2022-12-18 11:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734879, 1274912, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is a cute shot, although I''m not sure I agree with the sentiment. In most western countries the role of the ''traditional family'' is front and centre of many of the major political parties. However I get what you''re saying, perhaps that fathers are often overlooked in that key parent role. and as it''s a nice, technically competent shot I''m going to bump up my score a bit.</td>', 'This is a cute shot, although I''m not sure I agree with the sentiment. In most western countries the role of the ''traditional family'' is front and centre of many of the major political parties. However I get what you''re saying, perhaps that fathers are often overlooked in that key parent role. and as it''s a nice, technically competent shot I''m going to bump up my score a bit.', '2022-12-18 11:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734880, 1274870, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better photos that meets the subject clearly. I like the choice of crop and composition, and the processing too. I''m going to add 1 to the score to make it my favourite of the contest.</td>', 'This is one of the better photos that meets the subject clearly. I like the choice of crop and composition, and the processing too. I''m going to add 1 to the score to make it my favourite of the contest.', '2022-12-18 11:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734881, 1274917, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool and photogenic building, and whilst I think the link to climate activism and thus your meeting the challenge requirements is a little tenuous due to its small size I''m going to stick with my original high score as there''s something about the composition I love.</td>', 'This is a very cool and photogenic building, and whilst I think the link to climate activism and thus your meeting the challenge requirements is a little tenuous due to its small size I''m going to stick with my original high score as there''s something about the composition I love.', '2022-12-18 11:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734882, 1274907, 29535, '<td valign="top">Technically this is one of the better captured images of the contest, but it''s a tenuous link to the contest theme I think... It''s a very cool portrait and a fun shot for sure. In another contest I could easily be giving this 7+<br/> <br/>On second thought I think I understand the angle you''re going for, so I''m going to vote with my gut on this one and hope that if I''m in the minority of getting what you were going for it will at least bump up your score, and if it''s just me being dense well no harm done!</td>', 'Technically this is one of the better captured images of the contest, but it''s a tenuous link to the contest theme I think... It''s a very cool portrait and a fun shot for sure. In another contest I could easily be giving this 7+ On second thought I think I understand the angle you''re going for, so I''m going to vote with my gut on this one and hope that if I''m in the minority of getting what you were going for it will at least bump up your score, and if it''s just me being dense well no harm done!', '2022-12-18 11:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734883, 1274759, 29535, '<td valign="top">Woodland photography is challenging, and whilst I think this is one of the better attempts at meeting the challenge criteria I''m not sure I love this enough as a photo to give it high marks. The conditions in woodland have to usually be perfect to convey that sense of magic to a viewer who wasn''t there, although I totally get it as I often have the most amazing walks in the woods and come back with photos that don''t come close to conveying it.<br/> <br/>If you''re interested in woodland photography, check out Simon Baxter. He does some great YouTube tutorials on his thought process and what he looks for to capture the magic in the chaos of woodland.</td>', 'Woodland photography is challenging, and whilst I think this is one of the better attempts at meeting the challenge criteria I''m not sure I love this enough as a photo to give it high marks. The conditions in woodland have to usually be perfect to convey that sense of magic to a viewer who wasn''t there, although I totally get it as I often have the most amazing walks in the woods and come back with photos that don''t come close to conveying it. If you''re interested in woodland photography, check out Simon Baxter. He does some great YouTube tutorials on his thought process and what he looks for to capture the magic in the chaos of woodland.', '2022-12-18 11:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735015, 1274802, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the crispness of this photo with everything in focus.  I also like the hairs of the fly and the leaf that kind if go together.  It also meets the subject well.</td>', 'I like the crispness of this photo with everything in focus.  I also like the hairs of the fly and the leaf that kind if go together.  It also meets the subject well.', '2022-12-19 13:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735016, 1274912, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the soft focus on the left.  I like how you choose this for the topic this week.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the soft focus on the left.  I like how you choose this for the topic this week.  Nice job.', '2022-12-19 13:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735017, 1274876, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like how the blue stands out and how you caught the water frozen in time.  I do wish the bottle stayed looking translucent throughout not just at the neck.  Neat photo thanks.</td>', 'I like how the blue stands out and how you caught the water frozen in time.  I do wish the bottle stayed looking translucent throughout not just at the neck.  Neat photo thanks.', '2022-12-19 13:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735018, 1274751, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors and the simultaneous relaxed and rustic feel.  I like the composition as well.</td>', 'I like the bright colors and the simultaneous relaxed and rustic feel.  I like the composition as well.', '2022-12-19 13:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735019, 1274926, 150202, '<td valign="top">I love dog pics!  This one is great in that I like the contrast of the notes human on the background with the sharp and attentive pup in the front.</td>', 'I love dog pics!  This one is great in that I like the contrast of the notes human on the background with the sharp and attentive pup in the front.', '2022-12-19 13:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735020, 1274690, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  The colors or contrast seem kind of flat to me, maybe because the stick is a similar color to the bird.  Good focus on the bird.</td>', 'I like the composition.  The colors or contrast seem kind of flat to me, maybe because the stick is a similar color to the bird.  Good focus on the bird.', '2022-12-19 13:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735021, 1274913, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, although it looks more like a highrise window shot then a drone.  I think due to the angle.  I think focusing on the road or something more interesting could have taken this to the next level.  I like the lines of the buildings. Nice job.</td>', 'I like this idea, although it looks more like a highrise window shot then a drone.  I think due to the angle.  I think focusing on the road or something more interesting could have taken this to the next level.  I like the lines of the buildings. Nice job.', '2022-12-19 13:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735022, 1274904, 150202, '<td valign="top">I liked the reflection.  I like the bright blue but Mickey mouse is blue too which detracts from the picture.  Getting motion blur would have been cool too.</td>', 'I liked the reflection.  I like the bright blue but Mickey mouse is blue too which detracts from the picture.  Getting motion blur would have been cool too.', '2022-12-19 13:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735023, 1274879, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the ice looks kind of impressionist and the top one looks like it is sticking out is tongue.</td>', 'I like the ice looks kind of impressionist and the top one looks like it is sticking out is tongue.', '2022-12-19 13:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735024, 1274903, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract quality to this shot.  The trees on the right being sharp detracts from the picture.</td>', 'I like the abstract quality to this shot.  The trees on the right being sharp detracts from the picture.', '2022-12-19 13:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735026, 1274916, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like this photo I just don''t know how it fits with the title or this weeks subject.  Maybe you could have named it, underrated abstract photography!  Beautiful shot.</td>', 'I like this photo I just don''t know how it fits with the title or this weeks subject.  Maybe you could have named it, underrated abstract photography!  Beautiful shot.', '2022-12-19 13:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735027, 1274925, 150202, '<td valign="top">The little bits of light are just enough to be distracting without adding interest for me.  It doesn''t have enough interest to draw me in personally.  I like the softness.</td>', 'The little bits of light are just enough to be distracting without adding interest for me.  It doesn''t have enough interest to draw me in personally.  I like the softness.', '2022-12-19 13:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735029, 1274759, 150202, '<td valign="top">The colors is very blue for to the snow.  My eye wanders and isn''t sure as to which is the subject the trail or the tree.  It seems flat for me personally.  I might have tried to angle the tree in the picture differently.  I like the softness in the background.</td>', 'The colors is very blue for to the snow.  My eye wanders and isn''t sure as to which is the subject the trail or the tree.  It seems flat for me personally.  I might have tried to angle the tree in the picture differently.  I like the softness in the background.', '2022-12-19 13:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735030, 1274919, 150202, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and color.  Too much background for me.  I would have liked more interest, a closer spot or a different angle.  Nice job on getting the face exposed well with a hat.</td>', 'Nice contrast and color.  Too much background for me.  I would have liked more interest, a closer spot or a different angle.  Nice job on getting the face exposed well with a hat.', '2022-12-19 13:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735063, 1274802, 114285, '<td valign="top">Yes Roz, you have made me look at flies differently they are indeed beautiful and the way you photograph them, is astonishing, the details you capture are amazing.<br/> <br/>Bumping up, no need to say this will ribbon.</td>', 'Yes Roz, you have made me look at flies differently they are indeed beautiful and the way you photograph them, is astonishing, the details you capture are amazing. Bumping up, no need to say this will ribbon.', '2022-12-20 04:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735067, 1274904, 114285, '<td valign="top">Clouds are amazing, bit of a shoehorn but lovely shot nevertheless.</td>', 'Clouds are amazing, bit of a shoehorn but lovely shot nevertheless.', '2022-12-20 06:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735071, 1274870, 38162, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept and execution. Sky graffiti shows our carbon footprint quite dramatically but beauty does not come to mind. Over saturated ground area detracts.  GL. 6.</td>', 'Excellent concept and execution. Sky graffiti shows our carbon footprint quite dramatically but beauty does not come to mind. Over saturated ground area detracts.  GL. 6.', '2022-12-20 11:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
